{"availability":"available","full":"Heerozh/PromptUGUI","name":"PromptUGUI","description":"A solution that enables Unity uGUI development through LLM.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":91,"forks":4,"created":"2026-05-07T12:51:39Z","updated":"2026-10-08T07:28:26Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["agentic-workflow","ai","ui-framework","unity","unity-ui"],"demo":"https://heerozh.github.io/pugui/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.159Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.159Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.159Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.159Z","stars":91,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A solution that enables Unity 2022.3+ / Unity 6+ UI development through LLM.","It provides an extremely concise UI description language .ui.xml & .pxl , and a runtime parser that translates it into a uGUI hierarchy + Sprite images. The refined UI composition workflow enables procedural surface generation, making it suitable for LLMs to produce final visual results directly, bypassing the need for manual asset slicing.","More flexible than UI Toolkit, easier for custom styling, and tightly integrated with the GameObject system."],"features":["Minimal XML description language, tailored to how LLMs write","Hot reload — edit, save, see the result instantly","Fully reactive UI support — automatically switches layout to match the screen and device","Pixel-art-style UI support","Procedural surface support, Liquid-glass-style support"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Heerozh/PromptUGUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"91b5f9051819a9c9181e9b9288ec9eba601b7833fa24b51e472e653baf69edf0","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.334Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:22.334Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A solution that enables Unity 2022.3+ / Unity 6+ UI development through LLM.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/He